#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:346
msgid ""
"The plugin integrates with third-party plugins. Using the options from this "
"section, you can hide or turn off unwanted User Interface elements that "
"these plugins add to your admin panel by default. Options for the supported "
"plugin will be always presented on this screen - the plugin does not detect "
"if you have a specific plugin installed."
msgstr ""
"L’extension s’intègre à des extensions tierces. Grâce aux options de cette "
"section, vous pouvez masquer ou désactiver les éléments d’interface "
"indésirables que ces extensions ajoutent par défaut à votre panneau "
"d’administration. Les options des extensions prises en charge sont toujours "
"présentées sur cet écran : l’extension ne détecte pas si une extension "
"spécifique est installée."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:352
msgid ""
"WordPress often encourages you to install Jetpack and connect your site to "
"WordPress.com. If you do not want Jetpack, you can remove the installation "
"notice. If you are using Jetpack, you can disable Jetpack promotions."
msgstr ""
"WordPress vous incite souvent à installer Jetpack et à connecter votre site "
"à WordPress.com. Si vous ne voulez pas de Jetpack, vous pouvez retirer la "
"notification d’installation. Si vous utilisez Jetpack, vous pouvez "
"désactiver les promotions Jetpack."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:361
msgid "Remove Jetpack installation notice"
msgstr "Retirer la notification d’installation de Jetpack"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:362
msgid "This option will remove Jetpack installation notice."
msgstr "Cette option retirera la notification d’installation de Jetpack."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:372
msgid "Disable Jetpack Blaze feature"
msgstr "Désactiver la fonctionnalité Jetpack Blaze"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:373
msgid ""
"Use this option to disable the Jetpack Blaze feature. Blaze is a paid "
"feature that helps you promote your content across WordPress.com and Tumblr "
"networks."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez cette option pour désactiver la fonctionnalité Jetpack Blaze. Blaze "
"est une fonctionnalité payante qui vous aide à promouvoir votre contenu sur "
"les réseaux WordPress.com et Tumblr."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:383
msgid "Disable Jetpack promotions"
msgstr "Désactiver les promotions Jetpack"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:384
msgid ""
"This option will disable Jetpack-related notices that promote services like "
"the backup services VaultPress or WordPress Apps. Works only if you have "
"Jetpack installed."
msgstr ""
"Cette option désactivera les notifications liées à Jetpack qui font la "
"promotion de services comme le service de sauvegarde VaultPress ou les "
"applications WordPress. Fonctionne uniquement si Jetpack est installé."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:391
msgid ""
"Elementor is a great tool, but it may also lead to cluttering your WordPress "
"Dashboard. The options below will only be effective if you have Elementor "
"installed and activated."
msgstr ""
"Elementor est un excellent outil, mais il peut aussi encombrer votre tableau "
"de bord WordPress. Les options ci-dessous ne seront effectives que si "
"Elementor est installé et activé."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:400
msgid "Disable Elementor Dashboard widget"
msgstr "Désactiver le widget Tableau de bord Elementor"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:401
msgid ""
"This option will disable Elementor overview widget shown in WordPress "
"Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Cette option désactivera le widget de vue d’ensemble Elementor affiché dans "
"le tableau de bord WordPress."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:411
msgid "Disable Elementor Google Fonts package"
msgstr "Désactiver le paquet Google Fonts d’Elementor"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:412
msgid ""
"Enable this option to prevent Elementor from loading Google Fonts on your "
"website's frontend. This can help improve website speed and reduce external "
"requests to Google's servers."
msgstr ""
"Activez cette option pour empêcher Elementor de charger Google Fonts sur "
"l’interface publique de votre site. Cela peut aider à améliorer la vitesse "
"du site et à réduire les requêtes externes vers les serveurs de Google."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:419
msgid ""
"SkyVerge plugins are adding their own top-level admin menu item with their "
"Dashboard. You may not want to use it."
msgstr ""
"Les extensions SkyVerge ajoutent leur propre élément de menu "
"d’administration principal avec leur tableau de bord. Vous ne souhaitez peut-"
"être pas l’utiliser."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:428
msgid "Disable SkyVerge Dashboard"
msgstr "Désactiver le tableau de bord SkyVerge"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:429
msgid ""
"This option will disable SkyVerge Dashboard. Works only if you are using "
"SkyVerge plugins."
msgstr ""
"Cette option désactivera le tableau de bord SkyVerge. Fonctionne uniquement "
"si vous utilisez des extensions SkyVerge."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:436
msgid ""
"Yoast is a very handy plugin, but it may add to your admin panel some "
"elements that would not be your first choice."
msgstr ""
"Yoast est une extension très pratique, mais elle peut ajouter à votre "
"panneau d’administration des éléments qui ne seraient pas votre premier "
"choix."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:447
msgid "Disable Ads, Premium nags, Premium menu"
msgstr "Désactiver les publicités, relances Premium et le menu Premium"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:449
msgid ""
"If you do not want Yoast to scream about the premium version at all times, "
"use this option. This option will disable Ads, Premium nags, Premium menu."
msgstr ""
"Si vous ne voulez pas que Yoast vous rappelle sans cesse sa version premium, "
"utilisez cette option. Cette option désactivera les publicités, les relances "
"Premium et le menu Premium."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:460
msgid "Disable Yoast SEO Admin bar item"
msgstr "Désactiver l’élément de la barre d’administration Yoast SEO"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:462
msgid "This option will hide Yoast SEO item from WordPress Admin bar."
msgstr ""
"Cette option masquera l’élément Yoast SEO de la barre d’administration "
"WordPress."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:473
msgid "Remove Yoast HTML Comments from the Front-end"
msgstr "Retirer les commentaires HTML de Yoast de l’interface publique"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:475
msgid ""
"Yoast SEO does include some HTML commented-out code on your site's front. It "
"may lead to weaker page performance."
msgstr ""
"Yoast SEO ajoute du code HTML en commentaire sur l’interface publique de "
"votre site. Cela peut réduire les performances des pages."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:488
msgid ""
"This option will Remove the Yoast SEO widget from your WordPress Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Cette option retirera le widget Yoast SEO de votre tableau de bord WordPress."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:495
msgid ""
"We all love Contact Form 7 for flexibility, but loading tons of CSS and "
"javascript on every subpage of your WordPress frontend may be frustrating "
"for you and for your visitors. Why don't disable it globally and load it "
"manually only where it is needed?"
msgstr ""
"Nous aimons tous Contact Form 7 pour sa flexibilité, mais charger des tonnes "
"de CSS et de javascript sur chaque sous-page de votre interface WordPress "
"peut être frustrant pour vous et pour vos visiteurs. Pourquoi ne pas le "
"désactiver globalement et le charger manuellement uniquement là où il est "
"nécessaire ?"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:505
msgid "Disable Contact Form 7 JavaScript and CSS"
msgstr "Désactiver le JavaScript et le CSS de Contact Form 7"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:507
msgid ""
"This option will disable Contact Form 7 JavaScript and CSS files from "
"loading on every page. Works only if you are using Contact Form 7. Please "
"remember to add the scripts manually to your contact page."
msgstr ""
"Cette option désactivera le chargement des fichiers JavaScript et CSS "
"Contact Form 7 sur chaque page. Fonctionne uniquement si vous utilisez "
"Contact Form 7. N’oubliez pas d’ajouter les scripts manuellement à votre "
"page de contact."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:527
msgid ""
"This option will hide \"UpdraftPlus\" on admin toolbar. Works only if you "
"are using “UpdraftPlus”."
msgstr ""
"Cette option masquera « UpdraftPlus » dans la barre d’outils "
"d’administration. Fonctionne uniquement si vous utilisez « UpdraftPlus »."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:547
msgid ""
"This option will hide Advanced Custom Fields admin interface. Custom Fields "
"admin menu item won't be available."
msgstr ""
"Cette option masquera l’interface d’administration d’Advanced Custom Fields. "
"L’élément de menu d’administration des champs personnalisés ne sera plus "
"disponible."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:554
msgid ""
"Some users of the WPML plugin have reported that it can cause bloat on their "
"website, meaning that it can slow down the website's performance due to the "
"increased amount of data and code that the plugin adds to the site. This can "
"result in a slower page load time and decreased user experience. To reduce "
"the effects of WPML bloat, you may want to disable certain features of the "
"plugin:"
msgstr ""
"Certains utilisateurs de l’extension WPML ont signalé qu’elle pouvait "
"alourdir leur site, c’est-à-dire ralentir ses performances en raison de la "
"quantité accrue de données et de code que l’extension ajoute au site. Cela "
"peut entraîner un temps de chargement des pages plus long et une moins bonne "
"expérience utilisateur. Pour réduire les effets du superflu de WPML, vous "
"pouvez désactiver certaines fonctionnalités de l’extension :"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:566
msgid "This option will remove WPML Meta Generator Tag from WordPress Header."
msgstr ""
"Cette option retirera la balise meta generator de WPML de l’en-tête "
"WordPress."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:573
msgid ""
"WP Desk plugins, such as Flexible Checkout Fields, Flexible Invoices, "
"Shopmagic, and Flexible Product Fields add a \"Grow your business with WP "
"Desk\" widget to the WordPress dashboard. Disabling an unwanted dashboard "
"widget can help to improve the user experience by decluttering the dashboard "
"and making it easier to navigate:"
msgstr ""
"Les extensions WP Desk, comme Flexible Checkout Fields, Flexible Invoices, "
"Shopmagic et Flexible Product Fields, ajoutent un widget « Grow your "
"business with WP Desk » au tableau de bord WordPress. Désactiver un widget "
"de tableau de bord indésirable peut aider à améliorer l’expérience "
"utilisateur en désencombrant le tableau de bord et en facilitant la "
"navigation :"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:582
msgid "Disable \"Grow your business with WP Desk\" dashboard widget"
msgstr ""
"Désactiver le widget de tableau de bord « Développez votre entreprise avec "
"WP Desk »"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:583
msgid ""
"Check this option to disable \"Grow your business with WP Desk\" dashboard "
"widget which comes with WP Desk plugins"
msgstr ""
"Cochez cette option pour désactiver le widget de tableau de bord « Grow your "
"business with WP Desk » fourni avec les extensions WP Desk"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:590
msgid ""
"Octolize plugins, such as Flexible Shipping, add a new WooCommerce menu "
"entry."
msgstr ""
"Les extensions Octolize, comme Flexible Shipping, ajoutent une nouvelle "
"entrée au menu WooCommerce."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:599
msgid "Remove the \"Shipping Extensions\" WooCommerce menu entry"
msgstr "Retirer l’entrée de menu WooCommerce « Shipping Extensions »"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-thirdparty.php:600
msgid ""
"Tick this option to remove the annoying \"Shipping Extensions\" submenu from "
"top-level WooCommerce menu. Enabling this option simplifies your menu by "
"removing the unnecessary submenu, offering a simpler navigation experience"
msgstr ""
"Cochez cette option pour retirer l’agaçant sous-menu « Shipping Extensions » "
"du menu principal WooCommerce. L’activation de cette option simplifie votre "
"menu en retirant ce sous-menu inutile, pour une navigation plus simple"

